{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-17","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与平行四边形与平行线","englishTitle":"If there be two unequal straight lines, and to the greater there be applied a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, and if it divide it into parts which are commensurable in length, then the square on the greater will be greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable with the greater.","book":10,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.17/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","contentId":"euclid-10-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0512f818586191cb775d6ed368d726c1110a88c2dab61980c3c7145e556302f9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-17.statement","euclid-10-17.proof.1","euclid-10-17.construction.1","euclid-10-17.construction.2","euclid-10-17.proof.2","euclid-10-17.proof.3","euclid-10-17.proof.4","euclid-10-17.proof.5","euclid-10-17.proof.6","euclid-10-17.proof.7","euclid-10-17.proof.8","euclid-10-17.proof.9","euclid-10-17.proof.10","euclid-10-17.proof.11","euclid-10-17.proof.12","euclid-10-17.proof.13","euclid-10-17.proof.14","euclid-10-17.proof.15","euclid-10-17.proof.16","euclid-10-17.proof.17","euclid-10-17.conclusion","euclid-10-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c6f1f4816b65c5a28bcbab83cf9ac2f71d250cd3b6e202f640cc673ad485472","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be two unequal straight lines, and to the greater there be applied a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, and if it divide it into parts which are commensurable in length, then the square on the greater will be greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable with the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有两种不平等的直线,如果数量较大,则对较小的数量适用平行四边形等于正方形第4部分,并有正方形个缺陷,如果将其分成长度可公度个部分,则较大数量的正方形个部分将大于正方形个小部分,在数量较大的可公度直线上,比正方形个小部分的正方形个小部分多。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c17892234c6c8a4e699258ec3d0780aed13ca343322fed763acf41e9af7b98d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if the square on the greater be greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable with the greater, and if there be applied to the greater a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, it will divide it into parts which are commensurable in length."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果较大数量上的正方形比小数量上正方形的正方形大于数量上可公度的正方形,数量上更大,如果对较大数量应用正方形的4,平行四边形等于数量上正方形的4,数量上少,不足正方形,它将分为长度可公度的部位。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dd3c3edde20bc7f321c26aee1d902033c9e5414a261b6a62e5eb893fed6ec92","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, BC be two unequal straight lines, of which BC is the greater, and let there be applied to BC a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less, A, that is, equal to the square on the half of A, and deficient by a square figure. Let this be the rectangle BD, DC, [cf. Lemma] and let BD be commensurable in length with DC; I say that the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line commensurable with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将A, BC 改为两个不平等的直线,其中BC 数量较大, A, 可公度 和 平行四边形 等值为 正方形 的第四部分, 即 A 和 正方形 等值, 且有正方形 的缺陷。 将 矩形 BD, DC , [参考 引理] 改为 BD 等值为 长度可公度 和 DC ;我说,BC的正方形比A的正方形 大于正方形, 直线可公度,BC"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f530b938c64c62bca5f217a50c0c9e17fd28f754a62e7de8639becf12d284dc0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BC be bisected at the point E, and let EF be made equal to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC被分成两部分,E被分成EF,EF被分为DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"569549b010c408ba86c1017485a5fd52541789a129e92afacafa4753b1b880be","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the remainder DC is equal to BF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余的DC等于BF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80c68c429eb65ff80e951655f84e49a221d8c9157f57871a89f94b346b1480be","citations":["euclid-2-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line BC has been cut into equal parts at E, and into unequal parts at D, therefore the rectangle contained by BD, DC, together with the square on ED, is equal to the square on EC; [[II. 5](/principles/euclid-2-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BC线被切割成E平方,D平方,因此,BD和DC的矩形加上ED和正方形的矩形等于EC平方的正方形; [[II. 5](/principles/euclid-2-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7934c38ca4f8eb218fd3957e2fc15b77d4cd154ce8b9d78d6f186851619ae7b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the same is true of their quadruples; therefore four times the rectangle BD, DC, together with four times the square on DE, is equal to four times the square on EC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们的四倍数也是一样,因此,矩形 BD,DC的四倍,加上正方形和DE的四倍,等于EC的正方形的四倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b27285cdf06c6ef504b38ceab8a1a769f546460133a103286ca4e2a73acdeac7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on A is equal to four times the rectangle BD, DC; and the square on DF is equal to four times the square on DE, for DF is double of DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A的正方形等于矩形 BD的4倍,DC的正方形等于DE的4倍,DF的2倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e03c23eb7d3d0e176c46b0081dccfa8f3571b489c421e5bc301b9ca38d8d409","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on BC is equal to four times the square on EC, for again BC is double of CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC正方形等于EC正方形4倍,BCBC2倍（相关点与线段：CE）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1712a57f2b1af431b8fe65ec2b4eb5a1f0934955a2dd45dab633c761671a881b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the squares on A, DF are equal to the square on BC, so that the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A和DF的正方形等于BC的正方形,BC的正方形大于A和DF的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be09b4b6556ad3bbc3c52c6a40cd3383a6f214a7dedfd2bfde797704042c3add","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is to be proved that BC is also commensurable with DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC也是可公度,DF,这一点值得证明。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f8a06b695e9165a3ac9c54adbd27cb6839f169db3522a8712ba901987bc5e43","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since BD is commensurable in length with DC, therefore BC is also commensurable in length with CD. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BD为长度可公度,DC,因此BC也是长度可公度,CD。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0aeb8dc456e576c7d6e0ca3cc880c10a3531a2b2ad017c102e54c7227c657f3a","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD is commensurable in length with CD, BF, for CD is equal to BF. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是 CD 与 CD、BF 在长度上可公度，因为 CD 等于 BF。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be94772028bee1faaa4af792bde3f597f6a3463bf6c3527292ed2c2e5ca8a2bd","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is also commensurable in length with BF, CD, [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] so that BC is also commensurable in length with the remainder FD; [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)] therefore the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line commensurable with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC为长度可公度,BF,CD,BC,其余FD;因此,BC为长度可公度,CD,比A正方形,比正方形,直线可公度,直线BC。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"677fdab74c6b79aff00b8a70217e64392e447fd2be153301dea11a27da3cd41b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the square on BC be greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line commensurable with BC, let a parallelogram be applied to BC equal to the fourth part of the square on A and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle BD, DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,BC的正方形比A的正方形长,可公度直线比BC直线正方形高,A直线等于BC正方形第四段,有正方形数字不足,平行四边形直线比矩形、BDDC高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe53a20d606bfbe77838ebbf396ad30ce8f0e59fc91c68fa7fc732a58295f20a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is to be proved that BD is commensurable in length with DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BD是长度可公度,DC是需要证明的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05e91e103059a95ffc521fde5395ebf5fff23eaef7aa8ee3df26596668ab7d0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"With the same construction, we can prove similarly that the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的建筑,我们可以证明,BC比正方形比A比正方形比FD比正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2229a4ab6e7111c5e68701058c7bc5fa8d214da09bc7d09cea71589a0e2a3021","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on BC is greater than the square on A by the square on a straight line commensurable with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC的正方形比A的正方形 和正方形直线可公度和BC的正方形还要多"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"adf1477a07cc72c9a2bffa65854b106f25a1dab5cfc7b1b41bf55de3f94a8fa3","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is commensurable in length with FD, so that BC is also commensurable in length with the remainder, the sum of BF, DC. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC是长度可公度,FD,BC也是长度可公度,其余为BF,DC。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6a613e50871c9667c7e80a0cbbdc233676cd8f4ce97ac8319f9e9225171322d","citations":["euclid-10-6","euclid-10-12","euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the sum of BF, DC is commensurable with DC, [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] so that BC is also commensurable in length with CD; [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] and therefore, separando, BD is commensurable in length with DC. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BF,DC是可公度和DC,BC也是长度可公度和CD,因此,塞帕兰多,BD是长度可公度和DC。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":20,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-17.source","contentId":"euclid-10-17","revisionId":"euclid-10-17@raw-0512f818586191cb","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6b5d8b665881656c8f32787a1516c5c81e191998e9218b71fe1399467b803b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.17/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.17\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-17:euclid-2-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-17.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-5","type":"dep